WEBVTT

01:50.030 --> 01:53.950
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.280 --> 01:56.759
[Episode 11]

01:59.350 --> 02:01.040
Develop it further according to the plan

02:01.040 --> 02:02.100
we just discussed.

02:02.350 --> 02:03.210
Sure, Mr. Xiao.

02:06.150 --> 02:06.680
Mr. Xiao,

02:06.840 --> 02:08.240
this needs your signature.

02:08.240 --> 02:08.800
Okay.

02:10.630 --> 02:11.560
Mr. Xiao,

02:11.560 --> 02:13.150
this proposal needs your confirmation
as well.

02:13.150 --> 02:13.590
Sure.

02:17.230 --> 02:18.230
The closing period

02:18.230 --> 02:19.560
will be a difficult one.

02:19.710 --> 02:21.170
I'll give everyone a break

02:21.280 --> 02:22.620
after the design competition concludes.

02:22.620 --> 02:25.020
-Thank you, Mr. Xiao.
-Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

02:25.410 --> 02:26.810
I was worried...

02:27.870 --> 02:29.430
that your injured hand

02:29.450 --> 02:30.800
would affect our progress.

02:30.800 --> 02:31.750
I didn't expect you

02:31.750 --> 02:33.310
to be so efficient.

02:42.590 --> 02:43.590
So, Xiaorou,

02:44.210 --> 02:46.360
that slap guy really got fired.

02:46.390 --> 02:47.430
Slap guy?

02:47.620 --> 02:48.970
What a nickname.

02:50.150 --> 02:52.480
Mr. Gong didn't mention this at the store?

02:53.040 --> 02:54.320
He never mentioned it.

02:55.860 --> 02:58.260
He does good deeds without seeking credit.

02:58.510 --> 02:59.350
But Xiaorou,

02:59.380 --> 03:00.420
you're amazing.

03:00.870 --> 03:02.270
If I encountered someone like that,

03:02.270 --> 03:03.530
I'd be scared to death.

03:04.190 --> 03:06.120
Did you tell Guangming about this?

03:06.360 --> 03:08.830
I heard that guy was brought

03:08.850 --> 03:09.850
to the club by him.

03:11.000 --> 03:11.680
I didn't.

03:12.470 --> 03:13.640
Didn't you add him

03:13.670 --> 03:15.170
on WeChat at the karaoke room last time?

03:15.170 --> 03:16.230
Don't you dare tell him either,

03:16.230 --> 03:17.890
or I'll take all of these away.

03:19.890 --> 03:21.550
What is he not supposed to say?

03:24.460 --> 03:26.210
Weren't you supposed
to be back only at night?

03:26.210 --> 03:27.560
That meeting was boring,

03:27.560 --> 03:28.560
so I slipped away.

03:30.910 --> 03:31.870
Thanks.

03:32.980 --> 03:35.310
What were you two secretly talking about?

03:37.710 --> 03:38.400
I gave him

03:38.400 --> 03:40.240
the most expensive beans

03:40.460 --> 03:41.120
at no extra charge,

03:41.120 --> 03:43.020
so I told him not to
tell others in the shop.

03:43.020 --> 03:44.020
Yes, Guangming.

03:44.220 --> 03:45.500
I can't say that.

03:46.370 --> 03:48.840
Otherwise I wouldn't get
such perks in the future.

03:48.840 --> 03:49.770
I'm leaving now.

03:50.900 --> 03:52.560
Come around when you're free.

03:59.160 --> 04:00.490
What are you looking at?

04:02.030 --> 04:03.430
There were too many people
at the karaoke that day,

04:03.430 --> 04:04.490
so I didn't notice.

04:06.140 --> 04:07.930
Li Yue is quite handsome.

04:09.220 --> 04:11.680
Well,
he is studying to be an actor after all.

04:13.710 --> 04:15.120
Just because he's handsome,

04:15.120 --> 04:17.720
you switch to the most expensive beans
for him?

04:21.079 --> 04:21.930
Why else?

04:21.950 --> 04:23.740
For his acting skills?

04:29.960 --> 04:31.720
What are you thinking?

04:31.750 --> 04:34.080
He's just a kid who hasn't even graduated.

04:34.920 --> 04:36.830
I thought you went to Jinshan—

04:36.830 --> 04:38.830
they don't produce lemons, do they?

04:38.920 --> 04:41.159
Why so sour?

04:42.270 --> 04:43.270
Have some lemons.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.120
What is it?

04:47.950 --> 04:50.360
This is from
the most famous dessert shop in Jinshan.

04:50.360 --> 04:51.310
I brought it back especially for you.

04:51.310 --> 04:53.240
See if it inspires you.

04:53.930 --> 04:55.640
You must've queued for really long!

04:55.640 --> 04:56.490
It's fine.

04:56.510 --> 04:57.860
I can slip away
from the conference

04:57.860 --> 04:58.720
for a few hours.

05:01.510 --> 05:02.070
How is it?

05:02.410 --> 05:03.410
It's delicious.

05:05.760 --> 05:06.760
By the way, honey.

05:07.480 --> 05:08.560
Can you come with me next week

05:08.560 --> 05:09.620
to a class reunion?

05:09.920 --> 05:10.890
That's so sudden.

05:10.890 --> 05:12.680
I ran into Cheng Han at the conference.

05:12.680 --> 05:14.510
He said he's been wanting to organize
this reunion for a long time.

05:14.510 --> 05:15.910
He's insisting that I go.

05:17.680 --> 05:18.240
Okay.

05:18.310 --> 05:18.840
Great.

05:23.600 --> 05:24.630
Zhan Jie is awake.

05:24.650 --> 05:26.380
I need to get back to the office.

05:26.580 --> 05:27.390
About the reunion,

05:27.390 --> 05:28.520
we have a deal, right?

05:28.520 --> 05:29.180
Be careful.

05:45.080 --> 05:46.680
Just brought this back from abroad.

05:46.680 --> 05:47.880
It's the last bottle.

05:49.550 --> 05:51.550
To have you open up your collection,

05:51.560 --> 05:53.890
looks like the steel order went smoothly.

05:53.950 --> 05:55.350
It's thanks to your help.

05:56.720 --> 05:57.630
But this trip

05:58.040 --> 05:59.640
has brought a bigger reward.

06:00.800 --> 06:01.630
For the past two years,

06:01.630 --> 06:02.830
that steel mill director

06:02.830 --> 06:03.750
you kept asking me about,

06:03.750 --> 06:05.510
I finally got news of him.

06:06.870 --> 06:07.800
Unfortunately,

06:08.000 --> 06:09.260
he's no longer around.

06:13.750 --> 06:15.280
According to his daughter,

06:15.830 --> 06:17.800
after the Xincheng Stadium incident,

06:17.800 --> 06:20.070
their steel mill was severely impacted.

06:20.750 --> 06:22.430
It went bankrupt shortly after.

06:22.430 --> 06:24.690
Less than two years after moving abroad,

06:24.920 --> 06:25.750
he passed away

06:25.870 --> 06:27.000
from illness.

06:29.240 --> 06:31.840
No wonder
we couldn't find him all these years.

06:34.310 --> 06:36.640
You've been looking for him all this time—

06:36.830 --> 06:37.870
why?

06:39.120 --> 06:40.850
You don't owe him money, do you?

06:42.430 --> 06:43.270
Uncle Xu.

06:43.270 --> 06:45.360
That consent form
couldn't have been signed by my father.

06:45.360 --> 06:47.560
The stadium collapse wasn't his fault.

06:50.920 --> 06:51.600
Yu.

06:52.920 --> 06:54.950
I worked with your father
for many years.

06:54.950 --> 06:55.800
I also believe

06:56.120 --> 06:59.560
there's something suspicious about him
signing that consent form.

06:59.560 --> 07:00.950
With his professional expertise,

07:00.950 --> 07:02.120
he definitely would have noticed

07:02.120 --> 07:04.780
something's off
with the hardness of the steel.

07:04.830 --> 07:05.510
But

07:06.750 --> 07:09.040
the case has been closed for so long now.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.270
That consent form

07:11.270 --> 07:13.430
was indeed signed
by your father's own hand.

07:13.430 --> 07:14.720
What you just said

07:15.630 --> 07:17.230
has no evidence to back it up.

07:18.190 --> 07:19.590
I'll definitely find it.

07:22.160 --> 07:23.800
Help me look for the people

07:24.070 --> 07:25.200
who worked with him.

07:26.390 --> 07:27.360
Some things

07:28.630 --> 07:30.560
must be thoroughly investigated.

07:41.460 --> 07:42.220
Mr. Xiao.

07:42.580 --> 07:44.340
Why did you leave the company first?

07:44.340 --> 07:45.870
Are you already home?

07:46.670 --> 07:47.310
No,

07:47.510 --> 07:48.380
I'm at a bar.

07:48.630 --> 07:50.260
Take the car back after you finish work.

07:50.260 --> 07:53.750
The doctor said you shouldn't drink
while your injury is still healing.

07:53.750 --> 07:54.220
I already...

07:54.220 --> 07:55.140
Old Mr. Li that lives in the lane

07:55.140 --> 07:56.380
also had a fracture before.

07:56.380 --> 07:58.140
He didn't listen to the doctor

07:58.310 --> 07:58.950
and drank,

07:58.950 --> 08:00.480
so his condition got worse.

08:05.900 --> 08:06.550
I got it.

08:18.350 --> 08:19.010
No, thanks.

08:31.510 --> 08:32.270
Mr. Xiao.

08:34.270 --> 08:34.950
Mr. Xiao?

08:43.669 --> 08:45.070
I brought you something.

08:45.150 --> 08:45.750
What is it?

08:47.030 --> 08:49.390
You can't eat seafood
if your hand is injured.

08:49.390 --> 08:51.580
So I brought you a substitute.

08:52.220 --> 08:53.860
Crab shell pastries.

08:55.460 --> 08:57.920
You don't know what crab shell pastries are?

08:58.310 --> 08:59.910
Green onion, seaweed,

09:00.190 --> 09:01.340
sugar, and red bean.

09:01.370 --> 09:02.830
See which flavor you like.

09:05.430 --> 09:06.760
Can you tell them apart?

09:10.270 --> 09:11.220
I think...

09:11.550 --> 09:12.270
I can't.

09:13.620 --> 09:15.220
I prepared a gift for you too.

09:20.460 --> 09:21.590
One final revision.

09:22.700 --> 09:24.560
You always say "final revision."

09:36.700 --> 09:37.670
What's going on?

09:38.070 --> 09:38.790
Mr. Wang!

09:39.150 --> 09:40.920
You're always so loud?

09:41.070 --> 09:42.270
What about it?

09:42.300 --> 09:43.360
The power keeps going out.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.230
At this frequency,

09:44.230 --> 09:46.700
there must be a problem
with the circuit itself.

09:46.700 --> 09:47.900
Let's go check it out.

09:57.100 --> 09:58.550
Hu, you're here!

09:58.620 --> 10:00.100
Can you help us take a look?

10:00.430 --> 10:02.340
Didn't you study architecture in college?

10:02.340 --> 10:03.980
You must know electricity.

10:03.980 --> 10:04.700
Actually...

10:04.700 --> 10:05.460
-Yeah.
-I...

10:05.460 --> 10:06.100
Hu,

10:06.100 --> 10:07.070
you're a professional.

10:07.070 --> 10:08.620
Please help us.

10:08.620 --> 10:10.580
I need to follow along
with the TV to learn

10:10.580 --> 10:11.610
the Jia Mu Si Aerobics.

10:11.610 --> 10:12.250
Exactly.

10:12.500 --> 10:13.620
Okay, I'll try.

10:14.580 --> 10:15.240
Let me do it.

10:15.500 --> 10:16.020
No need.

10:16.150 --> 10:17.010
I can handle it.

10:17.400 --> 10:18.250
I'll try.

10:18.860 --> 10:19.670
Um...

10:22.790 --> 10:23.800
What's happening?

10:23.800 --> 10:24.740
-What happened?
-What's wrong?

10:24.740 --> 10:25.820
-Why is it out again?
-It's out again.

10:25.820 --> 10:27.340
These are all tight.

10:27.340 --> 10:28.190
Well...

10:29.220 --> 10:30.790
Are you sure
as someone who studied architecture,

10:30.790 --> 10:32.520
you also understand circuits?

10:34.190 --> 10:36.950
Of course.
I even have an electrician's license.

10:38.320 --> 10:40.980
Don't question
your landlord if you can't help.

10:41.700 --> 10:44.100
I wouldn't dare. Take your time, landlord.

10:44.190 --> 10:46.700
Everyone's got some certificate
these days.

10:46.700 --> 10:48.340
Here. The insulation is broken.

10:48.340 --> 10:49.790
It's probably a short circuit.

10:49.790 --> 10:51.740
That's our Hu for you. So professional.

10:51.740 --> 10:53.270
She finds out the problems so quickly.

10:53.270 --> 10:54.340
What should we do now?

10:54.340 --> 10:56.340
Do we still need to find a repairman?

10:56.620 --> 10:58.950
I already called the building manager.

10:58.950 --> 10:59.740
They said

10:59.740 --> 11:02.140
the technician won't come until tomorrow.

11:03.070 --> 11:04.030
I thought you were

11:04.030 --> 11:05.620
on good terms with the manager.

11:05.620 --> 11:07.620
Why can't you get them to come today?

11:07.740 --> 11:08.390
Fine.

11:08.520 --> 11:08.880
Well,

11:08.910 --> 11:10.460
does anyone have insulated gloves?

11:10.460 --> 11:11.270
I can wear the gloves,

11:11.270 --> 11:13.030
wrap it up with electrical tape,

11:13.030 --> 11:14.860
and then cover it with a plastic bag
as a temporary fix.

11:14.860 --> 11:16.670
We can wait for the technician tomorrow.

11:16.670 --> 11:17.860
I have them. I'll go get them.

11:17.860 --> 11:19.150
Okay. Go get it.

11:19.550 --> 11:20.790
Hurry up!

11:20.790 --> 11:21.430
Hu Xiu.

11:22.350 --> 11:23.880
I think the problem is here.

11:25.190 --> 11:27.070
The wiring looks fine.

11:27.070 --> 11:28.580
The insulation is peeling off.

11:28.580 --> 11:30.100
The covering is damaged,

11:30.100 --> 11:31.070
but it's minor,

11:31.070 --> 11:33.070
not enough to cause a short circuit.

11:33.070 --> 11:34.550
This part isn't damaged at all,

11:34.550 --> 11:37.340
all the more it wouldn't have caused
the short circuit.

11:37.340 --> 11:38.340
I got them!

11:38.620 --> 11:39.620
The gloves are here.

11:39.620 --> 11:40.100
Thank you.

11:40.100 --> 11:41.460
-Here's the tape.
-Let me try.

11:41.460 --> 11:42.550
You stew meat every single day,

11:42.550 --> 11:44.070
causing the short circuits,

11:44.070 --> 11:45.800
but have all the things needed.

12:00.360 --> 12:01.740
Why isn't it working yet?

12:01.740 --> 12:02.820
What's going on?

12:04.030 --> 12:05.910
Let me check again.

12:09.460 --> 12:11.110
This cable is fine.

12:17.860 --> 12:18.460
It's back.

12:19.950 --> 12:20.790
Great.

12:20.790 --> 12:23.120
We have to count on young people
nowadays.

12:23.860 --> 12:24.700
Thank you.

12:24.700 --> 12:25.740
You're welcome.

12:26.430 --> 12:27.790
I'll go back to my class now,

12:27.790 --> 12:29.150
my Jia Mu Si Aerobics.

12:30.150 --> 12:31.950
Young people are really something.

12:31.950 --> 12:32.500
Mr. Xiao.

12:33.580 --> 12:34.790
Your hand is healed?

12:57.550 --> 12:58.100
Hey.

12:59.390 --> 13:00.100
Don't.

13:00.100 --> 13:00.550
Don't.

13:00.550 --> 13:01.550
Please, don't.

13:01.580 --> 13:04.180
If you push harder,
my old injury will flare up.

13:08.930 --> 13:09.450
Look,

13:09.710 --> 13:11.840
I think some of my strength is back now.

13:14.860 --> 13:15.700
Stop pretending.

13:15.700 --> 13:17.270
You're completely healed.

13:17.580 --> 13:19.640
Yet you're still ordering me around.

13:20.460 --> 13:22.700
How can you call that ordering you around?

13:22.700 --> 13:24.500
I drive and wash the car.

13:24.620 --> 13:25.980
I serve you in the day

13:25.980 --> 13:27.740
and work overtime drawing plans at night.

13:27.740 --> 13:29.910
These are all because of
your injured hand.

13:29.910 --> 13:31.790
Fine, it's not ordering me around—

13:31.790 --> 13:33.190
it's playing the victim.

13:36.100 --> 13:37.310
Playing the victim is one thing.

13:37.310 --> 13:38.310
Your hand was injured

13:38.310 --> 13:39.510
and that was my fault,

13:39.550 --> 13:42.410
but isn't it too much to hide that
you've recovered?

13:42.950 --> 13:43.550
It is.

13:46.460 --> 13:47.070
So,

13:47.620 --> 13:49.740
who's driving tomorrow, you or me?

13:50.070 --> 13:50.740
Me.

13:53.250 --> 13:53.980
Then,

13:54.000 --> 13:55.790
who's drawing these plans, you or me?

13:55.790 --> 13:56.430
You.

13:59.620 --> 14:00.460
After all,

14:01.460 --> 14:02.520
you're improving.

14:16.580 --> 14:17.620
Indeed.

14:18.460 --> 14:19.720
There's improvement.

14:50.150 --> 14:51.150
So sudden?

14:51.500 --> 14:51.950
Regard Café

14:51.950 --> 14:54.210
hasn't launched a new cake in a while now.

14:54.980 --> 14:56.640
I just suddenly got inspired.

14:58.700 --> 14:59.270
Hu Xiu.

15:02.190 --> 15:03.720
Mr. Xiao is looking for you.

15:05.380 --> 15:06.590
Wh-What happened?

15:08.010 --> 15:09.290
I can't say much.

15:09.310 --> 15:11.040
You'll know when you get there.

15:11.190 --> 15:12.070
Anyway,

15:12.550 --> 15:13.550
good luck.

15:37.220 --> 15:38.030
Mr. Xiao.

15:38.740 --> 15:39.340
Come in.

15:48.070 --> 15:48.670
Mr. Xiao.

15:49.390 --> 15:51.310
I-I was only slacking off
for a little while just now.

15:51.310 --> 15:54.310
I was working hard
on the drawings the rest of the time.

15:55.670 --> 15:56.800
It's not about that?

15:57.700 --> 15:58.390
Then...

16:01.030 --> 16:03.460
It's because I sneaked a bun

16:03.670 --> 16:05.070
in your car

16:05.310 --> 16:07.310
before you came down in the morning?

16:08.190 --> 16:10.990
I opened the window
for ventilation immediately.

16:13.270 --> 16:14.800
What did Sun Yifei tell you?

16:15.550 --> 16:16.580
Nothing much.

16:16.600 --> 16:18.840
He just told me good luck.

16:20.860 --> 16:22.390
You thought I'd retaliate?

16:23.310 --> 16:25.570
Mr. Xiao, you're not that kind of person.

16:26.860 --> 16:27.500
So...

16:28.190 --> 16:29.740
why did you call me in?

16:31.820 --> 16:33.390
I discussed with Ms. Zhou
and several designers,

16:33.390 --> 16:34.450
and we decided that

16:34.550 --> 16:35.810
for the Lemon project,

16:35.910 --> 16:37.390
we'll give you a designer credit.

16:37.390 --> 16:39.030
Of course,
your name will be at the very end.

16:39.030 --> 16:40.160
Can you accept that?

16:41.460 --> 16:42.190
Yes,

16:42.370 --> 16:43.250
of course I can.

16:43.430 --> 16:44.820
Everyone did more work than I did.

16:44.820 --> 16:47.340
I'm just the one enjoying the shade
under the tree.

16:47.340 --> 16:47.940
All right,

16:48.070 --> 16:49.530
that's all. You can go now.

16:50.090 --> 16:51.330
Th-That's it?

16:52.390 --> 16:52.990
What else?

16:54.460 --> 16:56.790
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.
I shall take my leave.

17:00.670 --> 17:01.530
Anything else?

17:02.340 --> 17:03.030
Mr. Xiao,

17:03.030 --> 17:05.089
will you be home tomorrow afternoon?

17:06.890 --> 17:08.420
I want to treat you to a meal.

17:08.670 --> 17:10.349
I heard the new restaurant
at the lane entrance

17:10.349 --> 17:11.260
is quite good.

17:11.550 --> 17:13.540
You're being nice for no good reason.

17:13.540 --> 17:15.430
I'm just showing my gratitude.

17:15.520 --> 17:16.430
Look at you.

17:16.460 --> 17:18.260
Your hand got hurt because of me.

17:18.950 --> 17:21.020
But you didn't deduct my money
and shared the rent with me.

17:21.020 --> 17:23.500
Now you're allowing me
to hitch your ride to work,

17:23.500 --> 17:26.099
and now you're giving me credit
on the project.

17:29.950 --> 17:31.210
When you put it that way,

17:31.210 --> 17:31.900
indeed,

17:31.920 --> 17:33.380
I should accept this meal.

17:34.670 --> 17:35.390
Send me the address.

17:35.390 --> 17:37.120
What time tomorrow afternoon?

17:37.300 --> 17:38.220
As for the time,

17:38.220 --> 17:39.420
I haven't set one yet.

17:41.630 --> 17:42.190
Mr. Xiao,

17:42.190 --> 17:43.910
tomorrow is Saturday anyway.

17:44.150 --> 17:45.190
If you're home,

17:45.190 --> 17:45.870
you can come down

17:45.870 --> 17:47.070
after I holler at you.

17:49.540 --> 17:51.000
I might not be at home then.

17:51.870 --> 17:53.910
You're either in the lane
or at the company.

17:53.910 --> 17:55.300
At most, you might work part-time
at the murder mystery game place.

17:55.300 --> 17:56.630
Where else would you go?

17:58.260 --> 17:59.110
What I mean is,

17:59.110 --> 18:00.390
just wait for my message.

18:00.390 --> 18:01.650
So it's settled, okay?

18:28.500 --> 18:29.500
You're done with your drawing?

18:29.500 --> 18:31.060
I came to bring you this.

18:36.950 --> 18:38.150
The attic space is limited.

18:38.150 --> 18:39.390
Given how one would go in and out,

18:39.390 --> 18:41.830
this is your path to the bed

18:41.980 --> 18:44.510
and where you're most likely
to hit your head.

18:44.980 --> 18:47.000
With something this eye-catching here,

18:47.000 --> 18:49.060
you'll definitely notice it, right?

18:51.790 --> 18:52.460
Mr. Xiao,

18:52.920 --> 18:55.560
you need to protect that head of yours

18:56.950 --> 18:58.610
or how else are we going to win?

19:05.540 --> 19:08.590
[Aunt]

19:09.540 --> 19:10.220
Auntie.

19:10.740 --> 19:11.630
Xiu,

19:11.630 --> 19:12.690
have you been busy?

19:13.220 --> 19:14.020
Not too bad.

19:14.020 --> 19:15.740
What's up? Why the sudden call?

19:15.740 --> 19:16.980
Did your dad tell you

19:16.980 --> 19:18.390
about the blind date?

19:19.300 --> 19:20.230
He mentioned it.

19:20.350 --> 19:21.780
Tomorrow is Saturday.

19:22.110 --> 19:22.980
That young man

19:22.980 --> 19:24.630
wants to meet you.

19:24.950 --> 19:26.350
Where should you meet?

19:27.500 --> 19:28.910
Best if it's afternoon,

19:29.220 --> 19:31.020
so you can have dinner together.

19:36.420 --> 19:38.740
Auntie, I've told my dad about this.

19:38.960 --> 19:40.000
Let's forget it.

19:40.500 --> 19:41.700
You told him that?

19:42.390 --> 19:44.060
Your father didn't mention it to me.

19:44.060 --> 19:44.590
Look,

19:44.590 --> 19:46.950
how am I supposed to
explain this to them now?

19:46.950 --> 19:47.700
No.

19:48.060 --> 19:49.620
I have to talk to your father.

19:49.620 --> 19:50.270
Auntie,

19:50.530 --> 19:51.960
don't bother my dad.

19:52.430 --> 19:54.430
He's probably stressed out lately.

19:55.460 --> 19:57.590
Forget it. Send me that guy's WeChat.

19:57.980 --> 19:59.260
Don't be late, then.

19:59.540 --> 20:00.540
I know.

20:00.540 --> 20:01.780
I'll be there on time.

20:01.950 --> 20:02.700
Okay.

20:18.590 --> 20:19.220
Xiao.

20:19.500 --> 20:21.630
Want to pick up a shift tomorrow?

20:21.740 --> 20:22.740
It's been a while.

20:22.740 --> 20:23.470
I'm not free.

20:24.390 --> 20:25.670
Why? Got a date?

20:27.150 --> 20:27.870
I did,

20:28.110 --> 20:29.910
but now it's probably canceled.

20:30.540 --> 20:32.020
So you got stood up?

20:32.380 --> 20:33.060
What kind of client

20:33.060 --> 20:34.260
would dare to do that?

20:34.350 --> 20:36.210
Anyway, come over if you're free.

20:38.540 --> 20:39.140
Forget it.

20:40.800 --> 20:41.880
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

20:42.470 --> 20:43.630
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

20:44.220 --> 20:45.280
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

20:45.870 --> 20:47.110
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

20:48.460 --> 20:49.740
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

20:50.870 --> 20:52.220
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

20:53.060 --> 20:54.220
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

20:55.560 --> 20:56.880
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

20:57.460 --> 20:58.220
Mr. Xiao,

20:58.710 --> 21:00.190
is your head okay?

21:00.870 --> 21:01.930
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

21:02.330 --> 21:02.870
Shut up!

21:02.870 --> 21:03.950
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

21:04.500 --> 21:05.720
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

21:06.910 --> 21:08.200
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

21:09.380 --> 21:10.620
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

21:10.980 --> 21:11.670
Mr. Xiao,

21:11.950 --> 21:14.250
twist its ears
and it will stop laughing at you.

21:14.250 --> 21:15.920
Haha! Idiot! Idiot

21:16.220 --> 21:17.570
Haha! Id—

22:12.110 --> 22:13.460
I'm waiting for you.

22:17.150 --> 22:18.020
You...

22:18.060 --> 22:19.110
Well,

22:19.130 --> 22:21.060
I can only go out when you get there.

22:33.460 --> 22:34.830
I don't even dare to face him now.

22:34.830 --> 22:37.030
I'm afraid he'll ask when I'm going out.

22:38.370 --> 22:39.640
So can you give me a definite time

22:39.640 --> 22:41.160
you'll get there.

22:41.430 --> 22:42.670
I finished my work ages ago.

22:42.670 --> 22:44.630
It's the delivery guy
who hasn't shown up yet.

22:44.630 --> 22:46.030
I've already rushed him.

22:46.190 --> 22:46.870
Zhao.

22:47.190 --> 22:49.060
If you want to start this new business,

22:49.060 --> 22:50.540
you need more practice.

22:50.950 --> 22:53.080
That's why I'm using you for practice.

22:58.460 --> 23:00.390
My husband who's been missing all morning

23:00.390 --> 23:02.150
has finally replied to my message.

23:02.150 --> 23:03.060
He's so busy?

23:03.530 --> 23:05.360
Yes, we never see each other these days.

23:05.360 --> 23:07.110
We're almost like roommates now
instead of spouses.

23:07.110 --> 23:07.700
I'll get cracking.

23:07.700 --> 23:08.590
I've got to go.

23:11.630 --> 23:12.540
Your coffee.

23:12.770 --> 23:13.670
This isn't mine.

23:13.670 --> 23:14.630
I'll order now.

23:15.060 --> 23:15.870
Mr. Pei.

23:16.010 --> 23:16.770
I'm sorry.

23:17.980 --> 23:19.440
Good afternoon, Ms. Zhao.

23:20.300 --> 23:22.300
Mr. Pei, what would you like to have?

23:22.350 --> 23:23.950
I'll have an iced Americano.

23:24.220 --> 23:24.950
Sure.

23:26.430 --> 23:28.430
Your place has quite a unique decor.

23:29.020 --> 23:29.870
Yes.

23:33.150 --> 23:35.350
Mr. Pei,
you didn't come in to get a coffee

23:35.350 --> 23:37.190
because you just happened to pass by,
did you?

23:37.190 --> 23:38.910
I had some business
around this industrial park.

23:38.910 --> 23:40.260
You mentioned in your WeChat

23:40.260 --> 23:41.590
that you opened a café here,

23:41.590 --> 23:42.920
so I thought I'd drop by.

23:43.430 --> 23:44.890
Oh, and congratulations.

23:45.150 --> 23:47.080
I heard the car issue was resolved.

23:47.780 --> 23:50.040
Thank you so much for your help last time.

23:50.950 --> 23:52.390
Is your car fixed?

23:52.390 --> 23:54.740
And has the insurance claim
been processed?

23:54.740 --> 23:55.430
It's fixed.

23:55.980 --> 23:56.740
That's good.

23:58.020 --> 23:59.150
I'll make your coffee first.

23:59.150 --> 23:59.540
Go ahead.

23:59.540 --> 24:01.070
Okay, please wait a moment.

24:05.590 --> 24:07.190
I just heard you on the phone.

24:07.300 --> 24:08.700
You're already married?

24:09.500 --> 24:11.430
I got married right after college.

24:13.060 --> 24:14.150
That's quite rare.

24:14.150 --> 24:15.780
Most young people nowadays

24:15.780 --> 24:17.240
don't want to marry early.

24:17.870 --> 24:18.910
Like Ms. Hu.

24:19.390 --> 24:21.350
She's probably part of that majority.

24:21.350 --> 24:22.150
Xiu?

24:23.430 --> 24:24.590
She's single.

24:26.740 --> 24:27.390
Boss,

24:27.590 --> 24:29.520
you have a delivery order for cake?

24:29.670 --> 24:30.870
You're finally here.

24:31.020 --> 24:32.460
No. 27, Lane 9, Yanhua Road.

24:32.460 --> 24:33.460
Hu Xiu, right?

24:33.670 --> 24:35.670
Yes, that's right. It's over there.

24:35.800 --> 24:36.190
Here,

24:36.910 --> 24:37.740
this is it.

24:39.280 --> 24:40.430
[Thank you, Mr. Xiao.]

24:41.060 --> 24:42.060
Take it carefully.

24:42.060 --> 24:42.670
Thanks.

25:01.060 --> 25:03.150
Go to No. 27, Lane 9, Yanhua Road.

25:26.590 --> 25:27.190
Mr. Xiao,

25:27.460 --> 25:29.060
could you send me that rendering

25:29.060 --> 25:30.590
you took for optimization last time?

25:30.590 --> 25:31.990
It's on my work computer.

25:32.590 --> 25:33.110
That's fine.

25:33.110 --> 25:33.830
Give it to me on Monday.

25:33.830 --> 25:35.230
I can go to the office now.

25:51.300 --> 25:53.230
Leaving without saying anything.

25:53.350 --> 25:54.180
How rude.

26:04.150 --> 26:04.720
Young man,

26:04.720 --> 26:05.450
heading out?

26:05.950 --> 26:06.500
Yes.

26:10.020 --> 26:10.550
I'm free.

26:10.700 --> 26:11.260
Go ahead.

26:12.350 --> 26:13.350
Why is he here?

26:22.150 --> 26:23.150
Hello, Ms. Hu.

26:23.150 --> 26:24.700
I'm not sure which building it is.

26:24.700 --> 26:25.150
Well,

26:25.150 --> 26:26.540
do you see number 27?

26:26.570 --> 26:27.060
It's here.

26:27.060 --> 26:27.630
I see it.

26:27.740 --> 26:28.980
Go up to the second floor
using these stairs.

26:28.980 --> 26:29.830
Okay.

26:42.060 --> 26:42.670
Your cake.

26:42.670 --> 26:43.270
Thank you.

26:51.430 --> 26:52.150
Mr. Xiao,

26:52.390 --> 26:54.110
we can get ready to leave now.

26:58.220 --> 26:58.870
Mr. Xiao?

27:04.670 --> 27:05.350
Mr. Xiao?

27:08.020 --> 27:08.670
Mr. Xiao?

27:09.630 --> 27:10.670
I'm coming in.

27:13.350 --> 27:14.060
Mr. Xiao.

27:21.910 --> 27:22.910
He's not here?

27:25.980 --> 27:28.830
Sorry,
the subscriber you dialed is busy now.

27:29.020 --> 27:29.970
Please try—

27:30.060 --> 27:31.060
How rude.

27:32.460 --> 27:33.910
I was just a little late.

27:44.060 --> 27:45.670
Tell me,

27:45.670 --> 27:47.430
if a man and woman
aren't in a relationship,

27:47.430 --> 27:48.630
but live together,

27:49.020 --> 27:50.420
what could be the reason?

27:52.670 --> 27:54.270
It's actually quite common.

27:54.590 --> 27:55.990
They could be roommates.

27:57.260 --> 27:58.020
However,

27:58.460 --> 28:00.390
if we're talking about Xiao Zhiyu,

28:00.390 --> 28:02.120
that possibility is ruled out.

28:02.700 --> 28:05.300
He's likely pursuing
his female subordinate.

28:09.500 --> 28:10.500
Go check

28:10.700 --> 28:11.870
if he lives here,

28:12.110 --> 28:13.220
and if so,

28:13.220 --> 28:14.540
when he moved in.

28:15.590 --> 28:16.110
Okay.

28:30.950 --> 28:34.060
Sorry,
the subscriber you dialed is powered off.

28:34.300 --> 28:37.390
Please try again later. Sorry—

28:37.870 --> 28:38.670
Never mind.

28:38.670 --> 28:39.500
I was planning

28:39.500 --> 28:41.260
to treat you to a nice meal.

28:42.500 --> 28:43.830
I'll just eat by myself.

29:07.910 --> 29:08.540
Mr. Xiao.

29:09.590 --> 29:10.720
What a coincidence.

29:13.150 --> 29:14.480
How convenient for you.

29:14.500 --> 29:17.430
You don't even bother
looking for another location.

29:17.670 --> 29:19.070
Your date didn't show up?

29:19.440 --> 29:20.970
What are you talking about?

29:21.980 --> 29:23.020
Mr. Xiao, I admit

29:23.020 --> 29:24.150
I left a bit late today.

29:24.150 --> 29:25.010
It was my fault.

29:25.220 --> 29:27.150
But that's no reason to stand me up.

29:28.300 --> 29:29.460
If you had something to do, fine,

29:29.460 --> 29:30.870
but you're already eating here.

29:30.870 --> 29:31.930
What's this about?

29:31.950 --> 29:33.610
You have the nerve to blame me?

29:34.670 --> 29:36.730
Weren't you meeting some blind date?

29:45.110 --> 29:45.700
Mr. Xiao,

29:45.700 --> 29:47.980
eavesdropping on others' conversations

29:47.980 --> 29:49.390
isn't a good habit.

29:51.590 --> 29:52.980
That was a shared area.

29:53.390 --> 29:54.060
Besides,

29:54.460 --> 29:56.150
you were the one
who put it on loudspeaker.

29:56.150 --> 29:57.280
You said things like

29:57.340 --> 30:00.400
you couldn't get out
of a blind date set up by relatives.

30:00.500 --> 30:01.460
I understand.

30:01.930 --> 30:02.980
I had things to do this afternoon too.

30:02.980 --> 30:04.110
I went to the office.

30:09.190 --> 30:09.870
But shouldn't you

30:09.870 --> 30:11.200
have told me in advance?

30:12.150 --> 30:13.460
I didn't tell you in advance

30:13.460 --> 30:15.320
because I wanted to surprise you.

30:16.540 --> 30:17.430
Surprise me?

30:25.700 --> 30:26.960
It's quite a surprise.

30:31.670 --> 30:32.540
Stop looking.

30:32.540 --> 30:34.200
The blind date didn't show up.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.040
Auntie,

30:37.060 --> 30:38.700
don't bother my dad.

30:39.150 --> 30:41.150
He's probably stressed out lately.

30:42.670 --> 30:44.730
Forget it. Send me that guy's WeChat.

30:45.910 --> 30:46.780
Also,

30:47.030 --> 30:48.980
next month
is our baby's first birthday party.

30:48.980 --> 30:50.220
I've sent you the address.

30:50.220 --> 30:51.920
Don't run off to work overtime again

30:51.920 --> 30:54.020
like you did last time
at the full-month celebration.

30:54.020 --> 30:56.220
Okay, I'll definitely be there on time.

31:03.150 --> 31:03.780
Hello.

31:03.980 --> 31:04.950
I'm Hu Xiu.

31:05.260 --> 31:07.020
Aunt Xiuying introduced me.

31:07.500 --> 31:08.350
I'm sorry,

31:08.430 --> 31:09.890
I can't meet you tomorrow.

31:11.780 --> 31:12.700
But in the afternoon,

31:12.700 --> 31:15.300
weren't you waiting for someone
to pick you up?

31:15.430 --> 31:17.540
I was waiting for the delivery guy.

31:17.870 --> 31:19.260
My friend is mainly a barista.

31:19.260 --> 31:21.060
She doesn't usually make desserts.

31:21.060 --> 31:22.590
The ingredients will only arrive at noon.

31:22.590 --> 31:24.110
She's not sure when she'll finish.

31:24.110 --> 31:25.910
I'm not sure when I can leave.

31:26.630 --> 31:29.290
So it turned
into this whole misunderstanding.

31:39.790 --> 31:40.420
Waiter.

31:43.570 --> 31:45.830
Take a look
and see what you'd like to eat.

31:50.300 --> 31:50.950
This one,

31:51.460 --> 31:52.740
this and this.

31:52.770 --> 31:53.550
I'll have all of these.

31:53.550 --> 31:54.180
Thank you.

31:59.190 --> 31:59.830
Mr. Xiao,

32:00.500 --> 32:01.830
can I ask you something?

32:02.060 --> 32:02.740
Go ahead.

32:03.500 --> 32:05.700
If you suspected I was standing you up,

32:06.060 --> 32:08.460
why didn't you confirm with me beforehand?

32:12.540 --> 32:13.430
There was nothing to confirm.

32:13.430 --> 32:14.500
I'm not that free.

32:16.910 --> 32:17.220
You thought

32:17.220 --> 32:18.830
I stood you up,

32:18.830 --> 32:20.890
yet you still sat here and had dinner.

32:29.190 --> 32:29.950
Mr. Xiao,

32:30.740 --> 32:33.670
you actually
wanted to have this meal too, didn't you?

32:33.670 --> 32:35.870
But you were too embarrassed to show it,

32:36.390 --> 32:38.540
so you didn't contact me first.

32:41.220 --> 32:42.020
That's right.

32:42.780 --> 32:44.350
It's rare for this somebody
to treat me to a meal.

32:44.350 --> 32:45.910
If I seemed too eager,

32:46.150 --> 32:47.480
I was afraid she'd think

32:47.590 --> 32:49.060
her boss is taking advantage

32:49.060 --> 32:50.660
and trying to get a free meal.

32:52.870 --> 32:54.110
Excuse me.

32:59.300 --> 33:00.030
Don't worry.

33:00.350 --> 33:01.950
This meal

33:02.150 --> 33:03.390
is to thank you.

33:03.630 --> 33:04.980
Whatever you say goes.

33:09.020 --> 33:10.300
Do we eat the cake now?

33:11.390 --> 33:12.190
What else?

33:12.260 --> 33:13.590
If we eat dinner first,

33:13.590 --> 33:15.120
we won't have room for cake.

33:21.390 --> 33:22.720
No need for the candles.

33:22.980 --> 33:25.240
How can you make wishes without candles?

33:26.500 --> 33:27.030
Mr. Xiao,

33:27.190 --> 33:29.630
don't you have anything special

33:29.710 --> 33:31.800
you absolutely want to come true?

33:45.090 --> 33:46.150
Then I'll go ahead.

33:47.430 --> 33:48.230
My first wish:

33:48.350 --> 33:51.080
I hope we don't have to revise
the drawings again.

33:53.430 --> 33:54.290
My second wish:

33:54.350 --> 33:56.300
I hope the design competition

33:57.220 --> 33:59.220
will be successful and go smoothly.

34:00.740 --> 34:02.300
My third wish...

34:16.389 --> 34:18.100
Why don't you make a wish?

34:20.179 --> 34:21.440
What wish did you make?

34:22.500 --> 34:23.350
I'm not telling you.

34:23.350 --> 34:24.949
It won't come true if I say it.

34:27.270 --> 34:27.710
Never mind.

34:27.710 --> 34:30.639
If you're not making a wish,
just blow out the candle.

34:54.389 --> 34:58.690
♪ Under the streetlight,
I grow increasingly weary ♪

35:00.840 --> 35:05.680
♪ A few specks of dust
drift by in the wind ♪

35:07.430 --> 35:09.390
Zhao is making it difficult for me.

35:07.780 --> 35:11.940
♪ The girl who once
basked in the sunlight ♪

35:11.100 --> 35:12.230
Alright, let's eat.

35:12.800 --> 35:15.720
♪ Where did she go to play? ♪

35:14.350 --> 35:15.480
It's quite romantic

35:16.160 --> 35:19.130
♪ I don't understand either ♪

35:21.370 --> 35:25.200
♪ Flicking through old chat logs ♪

35:27.450 --> 35:32.330
♪ I just realized the replies
were somewhat delayed ♪

35:29.460 --> 35:30.520
I'm driving again?

35:31.750 --> 35:33.210
Let's go see your parents.

35:33.470 --> 35:39.460
♪ At the crossroads of choices,
amidst the bustling crowd ♪

35:35.350 --> 35:35.790
Why...

35:35.910 --> 35:37.710
are you seeing my parents?

35:40.310 --> 35:41.460
I'm telling you to go.

35:40.700 --> 35:47.970
♪ Who hasn't paid the price
and still fallen short? ♪

35:41.460 --> 35:42.520
You go by yourself.

35:45.430 --> 35:47.890
Why would I see
my parents this late at night?

35:47.990 --> 35:52.540
♪ Stand with me tonight,
look at the starlight ♪

35:48.140 --> 35:48.870
If you don't go,

35:48.870 --> 35:50.930
how will you fulfill your third wish?

35:52.460 --> 35:53.660
It's Saturday today.

35:53.750 --> 35:54.620
There's no work tomorrow.

35:53.810 --> 35:59.860
♪ Even if the plot is changed dramatically
by fate again ♪

35:55.180 --> 35:56.870
It's a perfect night

35:56.870 --> 35:58.020
to clear things up.

36:00.270 --> 36:06.480
♪ I know the dark clouds will still come ♪

36:00.710 --> 36:01.270
Hu Xiu,

36:02.620 --> 36:03.950
only when we resolve our internal issues,

36:03.950 --> 36:06.350
can we face external challenges
together.

36:07.020 --> 36:15.370
♪ But in this world,
there will always be someone ♪

36:10.430 --> 36:12.230
I'm going to take your car, then.

36:12.350 --> 36:13.880
How will you get back, then?

36:14.750 --> 36:16.710
This place isn't far from the lane,

36:16.090 --> 36:19.370
♪ Who looks forward
with the same hope as me ♪

36:16.710 --> 36:18.440
but it's not that close either.

36:19.100 --> 36:20.030
I'll take a taxi.

36:23.060 --> 36:23.540
I'm going now.

36:23.540 --> 36:24.100
Go ahead.

37:36.580 --> 37:37.270
Xiu!

37:37.500 --> 37:38.020
Mom.

37:38.270 --> 37:39.350
Why are you here?

37:40.910 --> 37:42.020
Come in, come in.

37:49.710 --> 37:50.430
Your father and I

37:50.430 --> 37:52.020
were planning to
bring you some food tomorrow.

37:52.020 --> 37:53.270
I was about to text you

37:53.270 --> 37:54.330
when you showed up.

37:55.870 --> 37:58.200
I'll pack up some dishes from the kitchen.

38:16.950 --> 38:17.540
Dad,

38:18.460 --> 38:20.100
last time you came to see me,

38:20.620 --> 38:22.310
you went down and came back up—

38:23.430 --> 38:25.390
what did you want to tell me?

38:26.430 --> 38:27.980
Your aunt's little baby

38:28.980 --> 38:30.840
is having a first birthday party.

38:34.460 --> 38:35.910
You didn't come all this way

38:35.910 --> 38:37.640
just to ask about that, did you?

38:37.870 --> 38:38.660
No.

38:42.020 --> 38:43.830
I have good news to share

38:44.390 --> 38:45.430
with you both.

38:46.180 --> 38:47.410
Our firm

38:47.440 --> 38:48.770
is currently working on

38:48.980 --> 38:51.310
a design competition for a hotel project.

38:52.430 --> 38:53.750
It's quite a big project.

38:53.750 --> 38:54.810
When it concludes,

38:55.180 --> 38:56.110
I'll be credited

38:56.650 --> 38:58.210
as the designer.

39:05.710 --> 39:06.980
Then you must win.

39:18.280 --> 39:18.880
Dad.

39:19.180 --> 39:19.870
Xiu.

39:26.230 --> 39:27.100
Ever since

39:28.980 --> 39:30.140
I injured this leg

39:30.910 --> 39:31.870
of mine,

39:33.460 --> 39:34.590
I've always thought

39:41.580 --> 39:42.750
that in this life,

39:44.090 --> 39:46.350
I won't be able to walk properly anymore.

39:47.500 --> 39:49.350
But I never expected

39:50.540 --> 39:52.670
that I would end up holding you back...

39:53.830 --> 39:54.790
Holding you back

39:55.870 --> 39:57.800
from taking the path you wanted to.

39:59.710 --> 40:00.540
Dad, I...

40:02.060 --> 40:02.870
All right, all right.

40:02.870 --> 40:03.910
Let's not talk about it anymore.

40:03.910 --> 40:06.230
Take these dishes back with you

40:06.350 --> 40:07.830
and head home early.

40:08.100 --> 40:09.710
Let me know when you win

40:09.740 --> 40:10.700
the project.

40:13.390 --> 40:14.660
Dad, I've barely sat down

40:14.660 --> 40:16.620
and you're already sending me away?

40:16.620 --> 40:18.580
That's because if you don't leave soon,

40:18.580 --> 40:21.180
your father
won't be able to hold back anymore.

40:24.710 --> 40:26.620
Before I came, my boss told me

40:26.950 --> 40:28.830
it's Saturday today
and I don't have to work tomorrow.

40:28.830 --> 40:30.390
It's the perfect time to visit you both.

40:30.390 --> 40:31.430
What does that mean?

40:31.430 --> 40:32.580
It means

40:32.980 --> 40:36.040
I can cry, make a scene,
or even threaten dramatically.

40:36.540 --> 40:38.230
If it's not resolved,
we can keep talking.

40:38.230 --> 40:39.890
It's okay if we get emotional.

40:40.020 --> 40:41.140
I don't have work tomorrow anyway,

40:41.140 --> 40:43.540
so I have a whole day
to process everything.

40:44.980 --> 40:45.870
But,

40:46.430 --> 40:47.830
he probably doesn't know

40:48.100 --> 40:49.710
that my parents are

40:49.980 --> 40:51.500
the most reasonable people

40:51.500 --> 40:52.790
in the world.

40:52.790 --> 40:53.910
They understand

40:54.390 --> 40:55.720
everything right away.

40:59.020 --> 41:01.420
Your boss seems quite interesting though.

41:01.950 --> 41:02.870
I didn't embarrass myself

41:02.870 --> 41:04.530
when I met him last time, did I?

41:05.020 --> 41:05.910
No.

41:05.940 --> 41:06.820
Wait, wait.

41:06.870 --> 41:07.530
Speaking of

41:07.580 --> 41:09.540
your boss,

41:09.950 --> 41:11.660
there are many people

41:12.140 --> 41:13.500
who rent instead of buying
when they're starting

41:13.500 --> 41:14.140
their businesses.

41:14.140 --> 41:14.870
But

41:15.100 --> 41:16.160
to be living in that

41:16.390 --> 41:17.350
rundown attic

41:17.350 --> 41:18.500
is really unusual.

41:19.580 --> 41:20.950
Is he reliable?

41:21.310 --> 41:22.580
Of course he is.

41:24.540 --> 41:25.980
This guy,

41:26.350 --> 41:27.060
at first glance,

41:27.060 --> 41:29.060
his personality may seem ordinary.

41:29.910 --> 41:31.390
But after spending time with him,
you'll find

41:31.390 --> 41:33.790
he's actually quite easy
to get along with.

41:35.390 --> 41:36.230
He's kinda similar

41:36.230 --> 41:39.100
to Huang that lives in the lane.

41:38.020 --> 41:42.570
♪ Close your eyes for me ♪

41:40.660 --> 41:41.460
Huang?

41:42.390 --> 41:44.100
I don't remember anyone by that name.

41:44.090 --> 41:46.260
♪ Don't rush to wake up ♪

41:45.350 --> 41:46.140
Mom.

41:46.430 --> 41:48.790
Huang is Mrs. Liu's puppy.

41:46.740 --> 41:49.960
♪ Before the night ends ♪

41:49.710 --> 41:51.540
When I was little, every time I fed it,

41:51.540 --> 41:53.230
it always looked like
it wanted to bite me.

41:52.840 --> 41:58.160
♪ Will you stay with me? ♪

41:55.230 --> 41:57.950
But on the 21st time I fed it,

41:59.080 --> 42:01.080
♪ I won't search for ♪

41:59.580 --> 42:01.390
it rubbed my hand with its head

42:01.880 --> 42:04.690
♪ The reason we met ♪

42:04.710 --> 42:08.700
♪ Oh, special night ♪
